Problem: Ranking Hosts by Beds
Platform: StrataScratch | Difficulty: Medium
Window Function Used: DENSE_RANK()
Key Logic: Sum beds per host across all listings, DENSE_RANK globally so tied hosts share the same rank with no gaps

-- SOLUTION
SELECT
    host_id,
    SUM(n_beds) AS total_beds,
    DENSE_RANK() OVER (ORDER BY SUM(n_beds) DESC) AS host_rank
FROM airbnb_apartments
GROUP BY host_id
ORDER BY host_rank ASC;
